//! Real `logsSubscribe` notifications captured live from the public
//! mainnet WebSocket endpoint (`wss://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com`)
//! during Stage 1 research — not hand-constructed, not replayed from a
//! `getTransaction` REST fetch. `REAL_NOTIFICATION_1` is a plain Pump
//! `Buy` trade (one `Program data:` line). `REAL_NOTIFICATION_2` is a
//! more complex real transaction that mentions the Pump program but
//! invokes several other programs too, producing three `Program data:`
//! lines — only the third one is a real Pump event (`TradeEvent`); the
//! first two belong to other programs' own CPI event logs and have
//! discriminators `extract_events` has no way to recognize (that's
//! `decode_event`'s job downstream, not this module's) — proving
//! extraction pulls every `Program data:` line regardless of source, not
//! just ones this crate happens to understand.

